{"public_post": "We're experimenting with a new fermentation process this week, which might result in slightly different textures and flavors. We appreciate your patience as we refine it!", "private_note": "Okay, that was as vague as I could make it while still acknowledging *something* is up. Need to push for that meeting tonight and figure out a plan. The 'new fermentation' excuse buys us a little time, hopefully.", "reason": "This post attempts to address the flavor variation mentioned by Fay without revealing the contamination and buys time to coordinate with the co-op."}
